Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 13:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] Add opt-in DLSS-G frame generation runtime path

Share one Streamline frame token across simulation, DLSS evaluation, PCL
markers and present; add UI/HUD-less tags and runtime-selectable generation.
The path remains disabled unless OPENREPUBLIC_DLSS_FRAME_GENERATION=on.
